{"id":"limonade","lemma":"limonade","pos":"noun","rank":4878,"glosses":["lemonade; a serving of lemonade","a soda with a hint of lemon flavoring with sugar that is popular in France; a serving of this soda"],"ipa":"/li.mɔ.nad/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-limonade.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-limonade.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"limonades"},"formAudio":{"limonades":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-limonades.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je vais prendre de la limonade.","en":"I'll have some lemonade.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to take"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Tom a bu de la limonade.","en":"Tom drank lemonade.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to drink","l":"boire"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Si la vie vous donne des citrons, faites-en de la limonade.","en":"If life deals you lemons, make lemonade.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"lemon","l":"citron"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[9,11,"of the"]]},{"text":"Lorsque la vie te procure des citrons, fais de la limonade.","en":"When life gives you lemons, make lemonade.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to get, obtain","l":"procurer"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"lemon","l":"citron"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"of the"]]}]}